INSERT INTO quiz_questions (quiz_id, question_text, question_type, explanation, points, display_order, is_active, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT id, '[Q20] Reading Passage:
MEMORANDUM
To: All Department Heads
From: Executive Office
Date: August 20
Subject: Office Renovation Schedule

Please be advised that the main office building will undergo structural renovations beginning next Monday. All staff members on the 3rd floor will be relocated temporarily to Building B. Noise levels are expected to be higher than normal during work hours. We appreciate your cooperation during this improvement project.

