Please be advised that the main office building will undergo structural renovations beginning next Monday. All staff members on the 3rd floor will be relocated temporarily to Building B. Noise levels are expected to be higher than normal during work hours. We appreciate your cooperation during this improvement project.

Question: What is the main purpose of this memorandum?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Đoạn memo thông báo kế hoạch sửa chữa tòa nhà chính bắt đầu từ thứ Hai tới.', 1, 30, 1, NOW(), NOW()
FROM quizzes WHERE quiz_code = 'UPGRADE-500-01'
AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM quiz_questions WHERE quiz_id = (SELECT id FROM quizzes WHERE quiz_code = 'UPGRADE-500-01') AND display_order = 30);


